em to Children one night annually as  populations grew Santa and his elves  would have had to continue to migrate  further north to remain undetected by  other communities until eventually they  reach the North Pole here they have  stayed for centuries working together  harmoniously or otherwise to bring Joy  to the World each and every Christmas  and with that we come to the end of  another video what did you think please  share your thoughts in the comments  below and as always if you enjoyed this  video don't forget to like it and  subscribe to the channel until next time  remember Dobby is a free elf  foreign

